<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Admiral cautions it in talks.</title>
<headline>Admiral cautions it in talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Admiral Leisure World Ltd said on Thursday it was in talks to buy an international company which could have an impact on its share price.</p>
<p>It said if the acquisition was succesfully concluded, it would be financed partly by the issue of new shares and partly out of borrowings.</p>
<p>Shareholders were urged to exercise caution in their share dealings until a further announcement was made.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
